The  driver provides support for Intel Wireless 3160, 3165, 3168,
4165, 7260, 7265, 8260, and 8265 PCIe Mini Card Dual Band network
adapters.  By default, the driver configures the adapter for  BSS
operation  (aka infrastructure mode).  This mode requires the use
of an access point.  For more information on configuring this de‐
vice, see The driver was written by The driver only supports  the
802.11a/b/g  capabilities  offered  by  the adapters.  Additional
work is required in before 802.11n/802.11ac  modes  can  be  sup‐
ported.
